# Port patch 0339 (2026-11-21; v2: one quad record, RE4_ESP_QUADS): runs of plain effect sprites with one texture, pattern, blend and TEV/channel setup drawn as one GXBegin (quads through m_Mat on the CPU, the material colour per vertex); the same pictures. RE4_ESP_BATCH=0: as before.
